  "definition_ja": "求めた答えが正しいかどうかを調べること。方程式では、解をもとの式に代入して、両辺が等しくなるかを見る。",
  "definition_en": "To make sure an answer is right. For an equation, you substitute the solution back into the original equation and see if both sides are equal.",
